# Project Structure Guardrails (Summary)

- Use the structure documented in `040-project-structure.mdc` as the single source of truth. When in doubt, check that rule for the latest layout breakdown.
- Keep changes within the Turborepo boundaries: run workspace scripts via pnpm/turbo, reuse shared tooling, and avoid ad-hoc commands.
- Extend existing patterns (Next.js routes, TanStack providers, Hono routes, Drizzle schema) instead of creating parallel stacks. Only diverge if the user explicitly approves a restructuring.
